The program of omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m, compiled by the
driver for the machine's GPU and run there: each loop is an SPMD kernel
whose iterations the teams and their threads share, as many as the trip
count the host computes from the host_eval values needs, and it prints
what the sequential program prints.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

RUN: merkc -fopenmp -fdo-loops --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m -o %t
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY LIBOMPTARGET_INFO=17 %t 2> %t.info \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
RUN: FileCheck %s < %t.info
RUN: merkc -O2 -fopenmp -fdo-loops --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m -o %t.O2
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY LIBOMPTARGET_INFO=17 %t.O2 2> %t.O2.info \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
RUN: FileCheck %s < %t.O2.info
LIBOMPTARGET_LOOP_BARRIER overrides the barrier after each round of the
loops, which they have by default, in either direction; any other value is
reported and ignored.
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY LIBOMPTARGET_LOOP_BARRIER=off %t.O2 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY LIBOMPTARGET_LOOP_BARRIER=on %t.O2 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY LIBOMPTARGET_LOOP_BARRIER=sometimes %t.O2 2> %t.bad \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BAD < %t.bad
BAD-COUNT-1: LIBOMPTARGET_LOOP_BARRIER must be on or off, not 'sometimes'; the loops have barriers as compiled
BAD-NOT: LIBOMPTARGET_LOOP_BARRIER
CHECK: info: Entering OpenMP kernel at {{.*}}omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m:{{[0-9]+}}:5 with 5 arguments:
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(region_slot)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(N)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: tofrom(STATE_VARIABLE_Y_0)[800008]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(A)[8]
CHECK-NEXT: info: to(X)[800008]
CHECK: info: Launching kernel {{.*}}saxpy_4_0{{.*}} with [{{[0-9]+}},1,1] blocks and [{{[0-9]+}},1,1] threads in SPMD mode
Five iterations need one team.
CHECK: info: Launching kernel {{.*}}down_2_0{{.*}} with [1,1,1] blocks and [{{[0-9]+}},1,1] threads in SPMD mode
CHECK-COUNT-3: info: Entering OpenMP kernel at {{.*}}omp-target-teams-distribute-parallel-do.m:{{[0-9]+}}:5 with {{[0-9]+}} arguments:
CHECK-NOT: Entering OpenMP kernel
